  "version": "0.1.0",
  "title": "Hello on a 16x2 parallel LCD",
  "summary": "An Arduino Nano runs the LiquidCrystal HelloWorld example on a blue 16 x 2 HD44780 LCD over a 4-bit parallel bus, with a 10k trimmer setting the contrast. The top line reads hello, world! and the bottom line counts seconds.",
